<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<!-- Texto voltado pro público (Reino Unido) — inglês britânico de propósito (honour, organise, etc.), não americano. -->
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Subscribed — {{ site_title }}</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<style>
  :root {
    color-scheme: light dark;
    --bg: #0b0d12; --surface: #151822; --text: #eef0f4; --text-muted: #9aa1b2;
    --accent: #ff5f6d; --accent-2: #ff9f43; --border: #262b3a;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: light) {
    :root { --bg: #f5f6f8; --surface: #ffffff; --text: #14161c; --text-muted: #5c6270; --border: #e4e6eb; }
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text);
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }
  main {
    max-width: 480px; text-align: center; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px; padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
  }
  .badge { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0 0 0.75rem; }
  p { color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 1.75rem; }
  a.back-link {
    display: inline-block; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #fff; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2));
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <div class="badge">🎉</div>
  <h1>You're subscribed!</h1>
  <p>Your subscription to {{ site_title }} is confirmed. Keep an eye on your inbox — today's hand-picked deals will start landing there soon.</p>
  <a class="back-link" href="index.html">← Back to {{ site_title }}</a>
</main>
</body>
</html>
